      <span style="font-family:var(--label);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-40);white-space:nowrap">AI summaries</span><span style="white-space:nowrap">Attempted <span style="font-family:var(--label);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--fg-70)">4</span></span><span style="white-space:nowrap">Succeeded <span style="font-family:var(--label);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--fg-70)">3</span></span><span style="white-space:nowrap">Fell back to an excerpt <span style="font-family:var(--label);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--fg-70)">1</span></span><span style="white-space:nowrap">This month <span style="font-family:var(--label);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--fg-70)">4 of 300</span></span>
